DISCLAIMER ON USE
================================================================================

These skills provide DECISION-SUPPORT for EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689)
compliance, anchored on ISO/IEC 42001:2023 (AI Management System) and
ISO/IEC 27090:2025 (AI cybersecurity).

They do NOT constitute legal advice and do NOT substitute for:

  * Qualified legal counsel for binding interpretation of the regulation
  * Notified-body conformity assessment (art. 43) for high-risk AI systems
    under the Annex VII path (where applicable)
  * Accredited certification body audit for ISO/IEC 42001 certification
  * Member-State competent-authority approval for regulatory sandboxes
    (art. 57) or real-world testing (art. 60)

USE AT YOUR OWN RISK. Verify all skill outputs against the authoritative
sources (EUR-Lex, ISO catalogue, OJEU citations, AI Office publications,
JTC 21 work programme) before making compliance decisions or representations
to authorities.

